+## Mouse-driven demos
+
+Coordinates are zero-based terminal columns and rows, not pixels. For a target
+at column 12, row 5, a starting point is:
+
+```text
+MouseMove@300ms@Linear 24 8 12 5
+Sleep 250ms
+Ctrl+Click@120ms 12 5
+Sleep 350ms
+MouseMove@450ms@Linear 12 5 24 8
+```
 
